      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes in the following sense:\n\n1) There are build-time checks that will fail if the info in Android.bp isn\u0027t coherent with the manifest. These checks are turned off by default, but automatically turned on if `uses_libs`/`optional_uses_libs` is non-empty. So this CL enables them for the modified apps, but if I drop `uses_libs`/`optional_uses_libs`, the checks will be dropped as well.\n\n2) There is a global switch that I will turn on after I merge fixes in all projects, and it will enable the checks for all Soong apps whether they have `uses_libs`/`optional_uses_libs` or not.",
